{"edition_date":"2026-10-26","language":"en","subject":"AI Marketing Daily | 2026-10-26 | 6 key highlights","headline_count":14,"featured_count":6,"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>AI Marketing Daily | 2026-10-26 | 6 key highlights</title>\n<style>\n@media only screen and (max-width:620px) {\n  .wrap { width:100% !important; }\n  .mobile-pad { padding-left:18px !important;padding-right:18px !important; }\n  .mobile-heading { font-size:28px !important; }\n}\n</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F7F5EF;font-family:Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Six verified stories, what they mean for marketers, and what to do next.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F7F5EF\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 0\">\n<table class=\"wrap\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"620\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:620px;max-width:100%\">\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#11154A\" style=\"background:#11154A;background-image:linear-gradient(115deg,#553FBA,#2F5582,#11154A,#7D266B);border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;padding:25px 28px 28px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#D3FE66;letter-spacing:-.3px\">AI Marketing Daily</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#D6D4E8;padding-top:4px\">AI MARKETING INTELLIGENCE · HK / CN</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#D3FE66;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin-top:23px\">MORNING BRIEF · 26 October 2026</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-heading\" style=\"font-size:37px;line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-1px;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;margin-top:12px\">Less AI noise.<br>More marketing signal.</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#EDEBF6;margin-top:15px\">6 key highlights &nbsp;·&nbsp; 14 stories on the site</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#F7F5EF\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;padding:22px 22px 8px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#5A42F4\">TODAY’S BIG PICTURE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;color:#101114;margin:9px 0 10px\">Today&#x27;s three key shifts: ChatGPT Ads expansion, Safari identity-resolution protection, and Canva&#x27;s new image model. Figures and rollout status are checked against original sources.</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#656A73\">Curated for the agency team · Carrie Hui</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#F7F5EF\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;padding:20px 22px 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#101114\">Top 6 Key Highlights</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#656A73;margin-top:4px\">What happened. Why it matters. Where to read more.</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 22px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #39689F;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#39689F;letter-spacing:1.4px;padding-bottom:8px\">TODAY’S TOP STORY</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.45px;color:#39689F;padding-bottom:7px\">Campaign Asia &nbsp;·&nbsp; </div>\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=story-1#chatgpt-ads-expands-89-countries-7eb202\" style=\"font: 700 22px/1.28 Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#101114;text-decoration:none\">ChatGPT Ads expands to 89 countries; 100,000 advertisers is cumulative, not active reach</a>\n<p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#3C3F45\">OpenAI expanded ChatGPT Ads to 89 countries on October 21. The 100,000-plus advertiser figure counts businesses that have run campaigns since launch; 1.2 billion weekly ChatGPT users is not an ad-reach estimate.</p><div style=\"background:#EBE8FF;border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;padding:10px 13px;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#101114\"><b style=\"color:#5A42F4\">WHY IT MATTERS</b> — Media planners can evaluate country-level availability while distinguishing total weekly usage from ad-addressable reach and actual campaign performance.</div><div style=\"padding-top:12px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EBE8FF;color:#5438D6;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px\">BUSINESS IMPACT</span></div>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 22px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.45px;color:#3F5BC8;padding-bottom:7px\">Campaign Asia &nbsp;·&nbsp; </div>\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=story-2#apple-expands-safari-anti-tracking-0b7396\" style=\"font: 700 18px/1.28 Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#101114;text-decoration:none\">Apple expands Safari anti-tracking protection to third-party identity-resolution infrastructure</a>\n<p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#3C3F45\">Apple WebKit says Safari and WebKit in its OS 27 releases block network access to third-party identity-resolution infrastructure at the domain level to prevent cross-site tracking. It is not a blanket ban on every advertising identifier.</p><div style=\"background:#EBE8FF;border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;padding:10px 13px;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#101114\"><b style=\"color:#5A42F4\">WHY IT MATTERS</b> — Media and analytics teams should audit identity-resolution dependencies and measure OS 27 changes rather than assuming all identifiers are disabled.</div><div style=\"padding-top:12px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EBE8FF;color:#5438D6;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px\">BUSINESS IMPACT</span></div>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 22px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.45px;color:#3F5BC8;padding-bottom:7px\">Campaign Asia &nbsp;·&nbsp; </div>\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=story-3#campaign-asia-examines-scam-ads-60c81c\" style=\"font: 700 18px/1.28 Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#101114;text-decoration:none\">Campaign Asia examines AI scam ads and brand-trust risks across APAC</a>\n<p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#3C3F45\">Campaign Asia examines how generative tools can lower the barrier to producing impersonation scams and the resulting APAC concerns over advertiser verification and brand trust. Comparative regional growth rates remain unclear.</p><div style=\"background:#EBE8FF;border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;padding:10px 13px;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#101114\"><b style=\"color:#5A42F4\">WHY IT MATTERS</b> — Brand safety needs to address fraudulent impersonation and consumer deception as well as conventional adjacency.</div><div style=\"padding-top:12px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EBE8FF;color:#5438D6;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px\">BUSINESS IMPACT</span></div>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 22px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #9A3A9E;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.45px;color:#9A3A9E;padding-bottom:7px\">TechCrunch &nbsp;·&nbsp; </div>\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=story-4#apollo-economist-finds-little-visible-f7d447\" style=\"font: 700 16px/1.28 Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#101114;text-decoration:none\">Apollo economist finds little visible AI payoff in S&amp;P 493 financial indicators</a>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3C3F45\">Clients asking about AI ROI need reproducible business metrics and credible experiments, not just headline productivity claims.</p><div style=\"padding-top:12px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EBE8FF;color:#5438D6;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px\">BUSINESS IMPACT</span></div>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 22px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #7D266B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.45px;color:#7D266B;padding-bottom:7px\">Campaign Asia &nbsp;·&nbsp; </div>\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=story-5#iab-hk-c26-discusses-how-7add93\" style=\"font: 700 16px/1.28 Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#101114;text-decoration:none\">IAB HK C26 discusses how brands stay discoverable in agentic commerce</a>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3C3F45\">Hong Kong brands can test how AI systems represent their product information and whether agent-led discovery yields qualified enquiries.</p><div style=\"padding-top:12px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EBE8FF;color:#5438D6;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px\">BUSINESS IMPACT</span></div>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 22px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #7D266B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.45px;color:#7D266B;padding-bottom:7px\">Campaign Asia &nbsp;·&nbsp; </div>\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=story-6#campaign-asia-opinion-argues-marketing-dc0f43\" style=\"font: 700 16px/1.28 Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#101114;text-decoration:none\">Campaign Asia opinion argues marketing influence needs metrics beyond clicks</a>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#3C3F45\">Agency reporting should separate traffic, engagement and incremental outcomes rather than overclaiming from a single metric.</p><div style=\"padding-top:12px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EBE8FF;color:#5438D6;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.5px\">BUSINESS IMPACT</span></div>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#F7F5EF\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;padding:15px 22px 14px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#EBE8FF\" style=\"background:#EBE8FF;border-left:4px solid #5A42F4;border-radius:9px;padding:19px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#101114;margin-bottom:15px\">What Marketers Should Do</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 10px 10px 0;color:#5A42F4;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\">01</td><td style=\"padding:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#101114\">Check available markets, ad-addressable reach and measurement before proposing a pilot.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 10px 10px 0;color:#5A42F4;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\">02</td><td style=\"padding:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#101114\">Audit identity-resolution vendors and Safari data flows; test matching and attribution by OS version.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 10px 10px 0;color:#5A42F4;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\">03</td><td style=\"padding:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#101114\">Set up impersonation monitoring, takedown escalation and evidence preservation.</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#F7F5EF\" style=\"background:#F7F5EF;padding:12px 22px 27px;text-align:center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#5A42F4\" style=\"background:#5A42F4;border-radius:30px\">\n<a href=\"https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=en&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-26&amp;utm_content=read-full-brief\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 26px;color:#FFFFFF;font:700 14px Arial,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,sans-serif;text-decoration:none\">Read the full briefing &#8594;</a></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#656A73;margin-top:12px\">Read all 14 stories, their source links and deeper analysis on the website.</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#11154A\" style=\"background:#11154A;border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;padding:18px 24px;color:#D6D4E8;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6\">\nAI Marketing Daily · Curated by Carrie Hui<br>\nInternal agency briefing · Headlines link to the online edition.<br>\n26 October 2026\n</td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>"}
